<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="el">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Μαριάννα, αγάπη μου – Θα είμαστε πάντα μαζί;</title>
  <style>
    body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#fff5f8; font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif; text-align:center; }
    h1 { font-size:2.5rem; color:#e91e63; margin-top:2rem; }
    h2 { font-size:2rem; color:#333; margin:1rem 0; }
    .buttons { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1rem; }
    button {
      padding:1rem 2rem; font-size:1.5rem;
      border:none; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer;
      transition:all .3s ease;
    }
    .yes { background:#e91e63; color:#fff; }
    .yes:hover { transform:scale(1.05); }
    .no { background:#ccc; color:#555; position:relative; }
    .no:hover { transform:translateX(80px) rotate(5deg); }
    .message {
      display:none; font-size:1.8rem; color:#e91e63; margin-top:2rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Μαριάννα, αγάπη μου</h1>
  <h2>Θα είμαστε πάντα μαζί;</h2>
  <div class="buttons">
    <button class="yes" onclick="showMessage()">Ναι 💖</button>
    <button class="no">Όχι 😅</button>
  </div>
  <div class="message" id="message">
    Το ήξερα! Για πάντα μαζί, Μαριάννα μου 💍❤️
  </div>

  <script>
    function showMessage(){
      document.getElementById('message').style.display = 'block';
    }
    const noBtn = document.querySelector('.no');
    noBtn.addEventListener('mouseover', () => {
      const x = Math.random() * 200 - 100;
      const y = Math.random() * 100 - 50;
      noBtn.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
